{"translation":{"id":"eng_asv","name":"American Standard Version (1901)","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=eng-asv","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=eng-asv","license":{"attribution":"not-required","commercialUse":"allowed","derivatives":"allowed","copyleft":false,"publicDomain":true},"shortName":"ASV","englishName":"American Standard Version (1901)","language":"eng","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"154967f9f68504bdf9a8d7abaae4ef6a93f20f779df84e62c1c8828427731839","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/eng_asv/books.json","completeTranslationApiLink":"/api/eng_asv/complete.json","simpleCompleteTranslationApiLink":"/api/eng_asv/complete.simple.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31102,"languageName":"English","languageEnglishName":"English"},"book":{"id":"2JN","name":"2 John","commonName":"2 John","title":"THE SECOND EPISTLE OF JOHN","numberOfChapters":1,"totalNumberOfVerses":13},"chapters":[null,{"numberOfVerses":13,"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["The elder unto the elect lady and her children, whom I love in truth; and not I only, but also all they that know the truth;"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["for the truth’s sake which abideth in us, and it shall be with us for ever:"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["Grace, mercy, peace shall be with us, from God the Father, and from Jesus Christ, the Son of the Father, in truth and love."]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["I rejoice greatly that I have found certain of thy children walking in truth, even as we received commandment from the Father."]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["And now I beseech thee, lady, not as though I wrote to thee a new commandment, but that which we had from the beginning, that we love one another."]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["And this is love, that we should walk after his commandments. This is the commandment, even as ye heard from the beginning, that ye should walk in it."]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["For many deceivers are gone forth into the world, even they that confess not that Jesus Christ cometh in the flesh. This is the deceiver and the antichrist."]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["Look to yourselves, that ye lose not the things which we have wrought, but that ye receive a full reward."]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["Whosoever goeth onward and abideth not in the teaching of Christ, hath not God: he that abideth in the teaching, the same hath both the Father and the Son."]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["If any one cometh unto you, and bringeth not this teaching, receive him not into your house, and give him no greeting:"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["for he that giveth him greeting partaketh in his evil works."]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["Having many things to write unto you, I would not write them with paper and ink: but I hope to come unto you, and to speak face to face, that your joy may be made full."]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["The children of thine elect sister salute thee."]}],"footnotes":[]}}]}
